Package: com.fluoxetine.luros.agent-tools.disassembler
Name: Luros Disassembler
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Disassembly and Mach-O symbol tools for Luros's agent, for @FLAVOR@ jailbreaks
 An agent tool extension for Luros. It gives the agent two read-only tools: disassemble, which decodes instructions from a Mach-O binary with Capstone, and symbols, which lists a binary's symbol table. It runs as its own process and only when Luros's agent calls it.
